  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】出雲大社・玉造温泉のおすすめ宿5選！月夜のうさぎ・佳雲・皆美・長生閣の徹底比較</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-rose-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2\">⛩️ 「出雲大社すぐ」vs「出雲大社・玉造温泉おすすめ宿セレクション」どちらに泊まるべき？</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2 text-xs text-stone-800\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-amber-900\">🌅 出雲大社エリア（月夜のうさぎ / 佳雲）：</strong> 境内まで徒歩約8分。観光客の少ない早朝参拝（朝6:00〜）ができ、神聖な空気の中で縁結び祈願をしたい方に圧倒的人気。</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-amber-900\">♨️ 玉造温泉エリア（佳翠苑皆美 / 長生閣）：</strong> 奈良時代『出雲国風土記』で「神の湯」と讃えられた日本屈指の美肌泉質。名旅館のおもてなしと山陰の海の幸会席を堪能したい方向け。</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 出雲・玉造で後悔しない厳選5選</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">お宿　月夜のうさぎ（共立リゾート）</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.58</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/160910/160910.jpg\" alt=\"お宿　月夜のうさぎ（共立リゾート） 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 出雲大社まで徒歩8分！全館畳敷き＆豪華バイキングと無料貸切風呂が大人気</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">出雲大社正門通りまで徒歩圏内。館内は全館素足で歩ける畳敷きで、5つの無料貸切風呂と大浴場を完備。夕食バイキングでは、のどぐろや日本海の海の幸、揚げたて天ぷらが食べ放題。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>カップル、女子旅、ファミリー、早朝参拝をしたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>出雲大社への早朝参拝と快適な温泉バイキングを満喫するなら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F160910%2F160910.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】お宿　月夜のうさぎ（共立リゾート） の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">いにしえの宿　佳雲（共立リゾート）</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.67</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/160909/160909.jpg\" alt=\"いにしえの宿　佳雲（共立リゾート） 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 出雲の伝統美が息づく高級湯宿！全室に温泉檜風呂を備えた贅沢空間</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">月夜のうさぎに隣接するプレミアム和風旅館。客室には上質な天然温泉風呂が備わり、夕食は山陰の高級食材「しまね和牛」「出雲大社・玉造温泉おすすめ宿セレクション」を中心とした本格会席料理を落ち着いた個室風食事処でいただけます。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ご夫婦、記念日旅行、落ち着いた高級感を求める大人旅</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>出雲の神話と伝統に浸り最高級の会席料理を味わうならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F160909%2F160909.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】いにしえの宿　佳雲（共立リゾート） の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第3位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">玉造温泉　佳翠苑　皆美</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.67</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/7798/7798.jpg\" alt=\"玉造温泉　佳翠苑　皆美 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ プロが選ぶ日本のホテル・旅館100選上位常連！日本庭園と美肌温泉の極み</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">玉造温泉を代表する名旅館。手入れの行き届いた日本庭園、展望露天風呂「天遊の湯」、料理長が腕を振るう山陰の恵み会席、細やかなおもてなしのすべてが高水準。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>シニア、親孝行旅行、記念日、本物の旅館ステイを求める人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>玉造温泉で絶対に失敗しない最高のおもてなしを体験するならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F7798%2F7798.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】玉造温泉　佳翠苑　皆美 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第4位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">玉造温泉　玉造グランドホテル長生閣</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.41</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/10743/10743.jpg\" alt=\"玉造温泉　玉造グランドホテル長生閣 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bol